                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A   =
                                                             &lt;li&gt;=0A       =
                                                             &lt;p&gt;Next, the R=
un dialogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                 =
                   &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAnd=
Printers.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                      =
              &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                             =
       &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                          =
                                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                             =
                                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                 =
                                   &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Printers folder=
 will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                            =
    &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                =
    &lt;p&gt;Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A           =
                                                         &lt;/p&gt;=0A           =
                                                     &lt;/li&gt;=0A              =
                                                  &lt;li&gt;=0A                  =
                                                  &lt;p&gt;Click the Add Printer =
button and follow the prompts.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                      =
                          &lt;/li&gt;=0A=0A                                      =
                      &lt;/ul&gt;=0A                                             =
           &lt;/div&gt;=0A=0A                                                    =
    &lt;div class=3D&quot;shadow cardbackgroundcolor p-3 my-3 setformac&quot;&gt;=0A       =
                                                     &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;mt-2 my-3=
 text-primary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A                        =
                                    &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelisting p-0&quot;&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A =
                                                                   &lt;p&gt;First=
ly, you will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                         =
                                               printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A             =
                                                   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                =
                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A                    =
                                                &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printe=
r to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                 =
                   &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=
=0A                                                                        =
driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                             =
   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                =
&lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                    =
&lt;p&gt;Then, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                  =
                                              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                     =
                                           &lt;li&gt;=0A                         =
                                           &lt;p&gt;After that, go to the Apple M=
enu.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                =
&lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li=
&gt;=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;=
In the menu, you have to click the System and Preferences=0A               =
                                                         option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A    =
                                                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A       =
                                                         &lt;li&gt;=0A           =
                                                         &lt;p&gt;On the next scr=
een, select the Printers and Scanners=0A                                   =
                                     option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                        =
                                        &lt;/li&gt;=0A                           =
                                     &lt;li&gt;=0A                               =
                                     &lt;p&gt;Thereafter, you need to click the =
=E2=80=9C+=E2=80=9D sign and add the=0A                                    =
                                    printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                        =
                                        &lt;/li&gt;=0A                           =
